<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT sets div for select preferred shares.</title>
<headline>PLDT sets div for select preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co (PLDT) said on Tuesday its board had approved a 50 centavo cash dividend to holders of its convertible preferred shares series B, F, Q and V as of August 28.</p>
<p>The dividend is for the semi-annual period ending August 31, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on September 30.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
